Third-party components
----------------------

Tapecut is a Python application that runs against these projects; it does not
redistribute them. They are installed from PyPI by `pip install -r
requirements.txt` and remain under their own licences:

  PyQt6          GPL v3 (or a commercial Riverbank licence)
  whisperX       BSD-2-Clause
  faster-whisper MIT
  pyannote.audio MIT (model weights are separately gated on HuggingFace)
  Flask          BSD-3-Clause
  pydub          MIT
  sounddevice    MIT
  NumPy          BSD-3-Clause

ffmpeg and rclone are invoked as external programs (LGPL/GPL and MIT
respectively) and are likewise not redistributed here.

PyQt6 being GPL v3 is part of why Tapecut is AGPL v3: the desktop window is a
derivative of a GPL v3 library, and AGPL v3 is the licence that satisfies that
obligation while also covering the browser UI when it is served over a network.
